# Visage Bandit's "Plot {2}{U}" (CR 702.170a): on turn 1 Bot1 has three mana from Moxen that make no blue and cannot plot (the
# {U} is missing). On turn 3 Mox Sapphire makes the {U}, and with two other Moxen it is plotted for exactly {2}{U}, the pool
# empty after; it cannot be cast from exile that turn. On turn 5, with Bot1 controlling an Ornithopter, it is cast from exile
# without paying its mana cost and enters as a copy of it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Visage Bandit
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
